    <string name="message_129" formatted="false">"Installing with control"</string>
    <string name="message_130" formatted="false">"1. Select the port\'s openxray folder, not the Download root.\n2. Import a ZIP, 7z or extracted folder.\n3. Follow the FOMOD options or choose components manually.\n4. Enable mods in the order specified by their authors; the last takes priority.\n5. Review and apply with the game closed.\n\nTo uninstall: disable the mod and apply. The previous mod\'s version or the original file will be restored.\n\nRAR, split archives and other formats: extract first, then import the folder. Mods requiring DLLs, EXEs, patching tools or engine features missing from the port may be incompatible.\n\nMods installed before using this app are retained as the original state; they do not automatically appear in the library.\n\nImporting needs space for the extracted package and library. Keep a separate copy of your saves. Do not clear this app\'s data while you need its backups."</string>
